SUMMARY:Domegarde: Property tax (taxe foncière): last day to pay online
DESCRIPTION:20 October 2026. Online payment is due by midnight on 20 Octobe
 r 2026\; other payment methods by 15 October. Your own notice shows your d
 ate and amount. Source: https://www.service-public.gouv.fr/particuliers/ac
 tualites/A15144 (Checked 16 October 2026).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Property tax (taxe foncière): last day to pay online
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:domegarde-calendar-en-2-2026-11-25@domegarde.com
DTSTAMP:20261016T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261125
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261126
SUMMARY:Domegarde: Rent-cap trial due to end unless Parliament extends it
DESCRIPTION:25 November 2026 (24 on one official page). ANIL and the Assemb
 lée nationale bill no. 2039 give 25 November\; one Service-Public page sa
 ys 24. The legal text must settle it. Until then the cap still applies whe
 re it applies. See our post for where things stand. Source: https://www.an
 il.org/aj-experimentation-encadrement-niveau-loyers-zones-tendues/ (Checke
 d 16 October 2026).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Rent-cap trial due to end unless Parliament extends it
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:domegarde-calendar-en-3-2026-12-15@domegarde.com
DTSTAMP:20261016T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261215
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261216
SUMMARY:Domegarde: Business property tax (CFE): balance due
DESCRIPTION:15 December 2026. In general the balance is due by 15 December 
 inclusive\, or the next working day if that is a weekend or holiday. Check
  whether you owe it: some furnished landlords are exempt. Source: https://
 entreprendre.service-public.gouv.fr/vosdroits/F23547 (Checked 16 October 2
 026).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Business property tax (CFE): balance due
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:domegarde-calendar-en-4-2027-01-01@domegarde.com
DTSTAMP:20261016T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270102
SUMMARY:Domegarde: Vacancy tax: a single tax starts with the 2027 tax year
DESCRIPTION:1 January 2027. A home counts as vacant if it is empty on 1 Jan
 uary. One tax replaces the two old ones: one year of vacancy in high-deman
 d communes (17%\, then 34%)\, two years elsewhere if the council has intro
 duced it. Years of vacancy before 2027 count. Source: https://www.service-
 public.gouv.fr/particuliers/actualites/A18896 (Checked 16 October 2026).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Vacancy tax: a single tax starts with the 2027 tax year
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
