DTSTAMP:20261016T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270115
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270116
SUMMARY:Domegarde: IRL for Q4 2026 expected (expected)
DESCRIPTION:Around mid-January 2027. INSEE publishes each quarter's IRL aro
 und the middle of the following month (the Q4 2025 figure came out on 16 J
 anuary 2026). Leases that name Q4 as their reference quarter can then be r
 evised. Source: https://www.insee.fr/fr/statistiques/serie/001515333 (Chec
 ked 16 October 2026).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:IRL for Q4 2026 expected (expected)
TRIGGER:-P7D
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
