DTSTAMP:20261016T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270731
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270801
SUMMARY:Domegarde: Cap on rent increases at relet or renewal: due to end un
 less renewed
DESCRIPTION:31 July 2027. A decree of 20 July 2026 extends to 31 July 2027 
 the cap on rent increases when a home is relet or a lease renewed in high-
 demand (zone tendue) communes. Source: https://www.service-public.gouv.fr/
 particuliers/actualites/A17566 (Checked 16 October 2026).
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Cap on rent increases at relet or renewal: due to end unless re
 newed
TRIGGER:-P7D
